e vote \u2014 similar patterns in other systems often see the primary agent of a government collapse polling well briefly before corrections. PNL's 'opposition' positioning could be a negotiating posture (extracting concessions from Dan for eventual participation) rather than a locked strategic choice. Dan's continued consultation process without designation may be a deliberate delay tactic to let formation pressures intensify rather than evidence of genuine deadlock.",
